<title>UK: L-Bank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown three-year bond.</title>
<headline>L-Bank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Wood Commerz.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESKREDITBANK BADEN WUERTTEMBURG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.625    MATURITY    04.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.314   PAY DATE    04.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ/DE</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25-250-1M</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
